      "text": [
        " لَا يُفْطِرُ الرَّجُلُ فِي شَهْرِ رَمَضَانَ إِلَّا فِي سَبِيلِ حَقٍّ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Ali Bin Ibrahim, from his father, from Ibn Abu Umeyr, from one of his companions who said, ",
          "‘The man would not break (the Fast) during a Month of Ramazan except in a way of Truth’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "2. Ali ibn Ibrahim has narrated from his father from ibn abu ‘Umayr from certain persons of our people who has said the following: “He (the Imam), ‘Alayhi al-Salam, has said, ‘One must not stop fasting in the month of Ramadan except in the way of truth.’” "
        ]
      }
